{"content_hash": "6a83f5fa62061799", "version_id": 1024, "article_id": 103, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Anthropic raises $81bn in record IPO as AI experts revolt", "title_zh": "Anthropic上市募资813亿美元创纪录，AI专家集体抗议", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1690375?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620302044902-30315ad936cb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwaXBvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUxNDE3NzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Annie Spratt on Unsplash", "author": "Annie Spratt", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@anniespratt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-k35mDhjCJ0c?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(143, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(181, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "81ef2143d31f"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-20", "word_count": 281, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Anthropic, the company behind Claude, has listed on Nasdaq in the largest IPO ever. The same day, nearly a hundred leading AI researchers signed a letter saying the company should not be trusted with the future of AI.", "lead_zh": "Claude背后的公司Anthropic登陆纳斯达克，创下史上最大IPO纪录。就在同一天，近百位顶尖AI研究者联名发信，称不该把AI的未来交给这家公司。", "preview": "Anthropic began trading under the ticker ANT after selling 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. That beats the roughly $7", "preview_zh": "Anthropic以代码ANT开始交易，以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月约750亿美元的纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元股份。扣除费用和部分老股出售后，Anthropic预计可获得约105", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1007, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 124.875, "size_bytes": 750240, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 127.3, "size_bytes": 764784, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 135.125, "size_bytes": 811728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 115.475, "size_bytes": 693792, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 125.925, "size_bytes": 756576, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 331, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1b079706/content/data/versions/1024.json", "paragraphs": ["Anthropic began trading under the ticker ANT after selling 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. That beats the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion of extra shares. After fees and an old-share sale, Anthropic expects to receive about $105.4 billion.", "The listing caps a year in which Anthropic moved from cautious follower to market leader. It released new Claude models in June, September and November, and its revenue rose from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. In the first three quarters of 2026 it reached $33.2 billion, with $17 billion in the third quarter alone. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products.", "Its IPO filing reveals commitments of $900.9 billion for computing power and infrastructure, with $451.6 billion due by the end of 2030. Anthropic calls its key advantage a \"closed loop\": each Claude model helps build the next one, speeding up research. The filing also warns that powerful models could concentrate wealth, damage trust and cause harm through actions users cannot see.", "Critics say this is hypocritical. The \"MisAnthropic Statement\", signed by figures such as Judea Pearl and Thomas Wolf, argues that Anthropic markets itself as the safe AI company while selling that same technology as its main investment story. People who normally disagree on everything now agree on one point: no private company should gain so much control in the name of protecting humanity.", "Inside the company, employees called \"Ants\" describe a culture of urgency rather than wealth. Many will become millionaires but still share flats and work long hours."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Anthropic以代码ANT开始交易，以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月约750亿美元的纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元股份。扣除费用和部分老股出售后，Anthropic预计可获得约1054亿美元。", "这次上市为Anthropic从谨慎追随者变成市场领导者的一年画上句号。公司在6月、9月和11月接连发布新Claude模型，营收从2023年的4100万美元增至2025年的46亿美元。2026年前三季度营收达332亿美元，仅第三季度就有170亿美元。目前超过半数《财富》500强企业是其付费客户。", "招股书显示，Anthropic承诺投入9009亿美元用于算力和基础设施，其中4516亿美元将在2030年底前支出。公司把核心优势称为“闭环”：每一代Claude都帮助构建下一代，从而加快研发。招股书同时警告，强大模型可能集中财富、侵蚀信任，并通过用户看不见的行动造成伤害。", "批评者认为这很虚伪。《厌恶Anthropic声明》由Judea Pearl、Thomas Wolf等人联署，指出Anthropic一边把自己包装成最安全的AI公司，一边又把这项技术当作上市募资的主要卖点。平时几乎在所有议题上都对立的人，如今在一个问题上达成一致：没有哪家私营公司能以保护人类之名掌握这么大的控制权。", "公司内部，自称“蚂蚁”的员工描述的是一种紧迫感而非财富感的文化。许多人将变成百万富翁，却仍合租公寓、长时间工作。联合创始人Jack Clark如今预计2027年就会出现达到人类水平的AI研究员。投资者今后每个季度都要问一个简单问题：一家拼命求胜的公司，还能是那个保证AI安全的公司吗？"], "body": "Anthropic began trading under the ticker ANT after selling 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. That beats the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion of extra shares. After fees and an old-share sale, Anthropic expects to receive about $105.4 billion.\n\nThe listing caps a year in which Anthropic moved from cautious follower to market leader. It released new Claude models in June, September and November, and its revenue rose from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. In the first three quarters of 2026 it reached $33.2 billion, with $17 billion in the third quarter alone. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products.\n\nIts IPO filing reveals commitments of $900.9 billion for computing power and infrastructure, with $451.6 billion due by the end of 2030. Anthropic calls its key advantage a \"closed loop\": each Claude model helps build the next one, speeding up research. The filing also warns that powerful models could concentrate wealth, damage trust and cause harm through actions users cannot see.\n\nCritics say this is hypocritical. The \"MisAnthropic Statement\", signed by figures such as Judea Pearl and Thomas Wolf, argues that Anthropic markets itself as the safe AI company while selling that same technology as its main investment story. People who normally disagree on everything now agree on one point: no private company should gain so much control in the name of protecting humanity.\n\nInside the company, employees called \"Ants\" describe a culture of urgency rather than wealth. Many will become millionaires but still share flats and work long hours.", "body_zh": "Anthropic以代码ANT开始交易，以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月约750亿美元的纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元股份。扣除费用和部分老股出售后，Anthropic预计可获得约1054亿美元。\n\n这次上市为Anthropic从谨慎追随者变成市场领导者的一年画上句号。公司在6月、9月和11月接连发布新Claude模型，营收从2023年的4100万美元增至2025年的46亿美元。2026年前三季度营收达332亿美元，仅第三季度就有170亿美元。目前超过半数《财富》500强企业是其付费客户。\n\n招股书显示，Anthropic承诺投入9009亿美元用于算力和基础设施，其中4516亿美元将在2030年底前支出。公司把核心优势称为“闭环”：每一代Claude都帮助构建下一代，从而加快研发。招股书同时警告，强大模型可能集中财富、侵蚀信任，并通过用户看不见的行动造成伤害。\n\n批评者认为这很虚伪。《厌恶Anthropic声明》由Judea Pearl、Thomas Wolf等人联署，指出Anthropic一边把自己包装成最安全的AI公司，一边又把这项技术当作上市募资的主要卖点。平时几乎在所有议题上都对立的人，如今在一个问题上达成一致：没有哪家私营公司能以保护人类之名掌握这么大的控制权。\n\n公司内部，自称“蚂蚁”的员工描述的是一种紧迫感而非财富感的文化。许多人将变成百万富翁，却仍合租公寓、长时间工作。联合创始人Jack Clark如今预计2027年就会出现达到人类水平的AI研究员。投资者今后每个季度都要问一个简单问题：一家拼命求胜的公司，还能是那个保证AI安全的公司吗？", "text": "Anthropic began trading under the ticker ANT after selling 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. That beats the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion of extra shares. After fees and an old-share sale, Anthropic expects to receive about $105.4 billion. The listing caps a year in which Anthropic moved from cautious follower to market leader. It released new Claude models in June, September and November, and its revenue rose from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. In the first three quarters of 2026 it reached $33.2 billion, with $17 billion in the third quarter alone. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products. Its IPO filing reveals commitments of $900.9 billion for computing power and infrastructure, with $451.6 billion due by the end of 2030. Anthropic calls its key advantage a \"closed loop\": each Claude model helps build the next one, speeding up research. The filing also warns that powerful models could concentrate wealth, damage trust and cause harm through actions users cannot see. Critics say this is hypocritical. The \"MisAnthropic Statement\", signed by figures such as Judea Pearl and Thomas Wolf, argues that Anthropic markets itself as the safe AI company while selling that same technology as its main investment story. People who normally disagree on everything now agree on one point: no private company should gain so much control in the name of protecting humanity. Inside the company, employees called \"Ants\" describe a culture of urgency rather than wealth. Many will become millionaires but still share flats and work long hours.", "vocab": [{"word": "ticker", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票代码", "note": "股市用语，如 ticker symbol", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "raise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "募集（资金）", "note": "raise money / capital", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "listing", "pos": "noun", "zh": "上市", "note": "动词形式为 list", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "filing", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（上市）申报文件", "note": "IPO filing 招股书", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "commitment", "pos": "noun", "zh": "承诺；投入义务", "note": "常与 make 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "infrastructure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基础设施", "note": "此处指算力设施", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hypocritical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "虚伪的", "note": "名词 hypocrisy", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签署；联署", "note": "sign a letter", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "in the name of", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "以……之名", "note": "常含质疑语气", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "urgency", "pos": "noun", "zh": "紧迫感", "note": "a sense of urgency", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "quarter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "季度", "note": "财报常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T02:29:30.365050", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Anthropic", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.875, "sm": 325, "em": 875, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "began", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.225, "sm": 875, "em": 1225, "cs": 10, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "trading", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.587, "sm": 1225, "em": 1587, "cs": 16, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "under", "s": 1.587, "e": 1.762, "sm": 1587, "em": 1762, "cs": 24, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "the", "s": 1.762, "e": 1.85, "sm": 176